# Testing

When editing matching files:

- Apply engineering foundations first (always-applied rule).
- Load `skills/code/quality/testing/SKILL.md` for test-authoring rules.
- Load its `references/` only when the skill directs (including `references/python-pytest.md` for pytest files).

Key rules: test behavior at seams; mock only true I/O; prefer fakes and real temp files; share fixtures; one regression test per bug.
